        -:   64:  /**
        -:   65:   *  Primary class template _Hashtable.
        -:   66:   *
        -:   67:   *  @ingroup hashtable-detail
        -:   68:   *
        -:   69:   *  @tparam _Value  CopyConstructible type.
        -:   70:   *
        -:   71:   *  @tparam _Key    CopyConstructible type.
        -:   72:   *
        -:   73:   *  @tparam _Alloc  An allocator type
